WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.220 --> 00:00:07.595
First, computers often swap data in text formats written for human eyes, forcing machines to spend extra work.

2
00:00:07.935 --> 00:00:15.564
Second, reading indented configuration text took over two thousand times more chip energy than reading compact machine numbers.

3
00:00:15.904 --> 00:00:22.629
Third, chopping structured text into AI word pieces burned twelve times more energy than parsing the text itself.
